# ROM guard: cartridges live in public/roms and deploy with the site.
# Homebrew carts are author-released freeware (attribution:
# public/roms/CREDITS.md). PowerFest 94, Yoshi's Island and Aladdin are
# the site owner's own cartridges added for the Games room — keep the
# git repository PRIVATE while they are in it.
*.sfc
*.smc
*.fig
*.srm
*.gba
*.gb
*.gbc
*.nes
*.fds
*.z64
*.v64
!public/roms/*.sfc

# MultiHero: the official WASM web build is served from
# public/multihero/multihero-web/ (web port MIT by richardyusan, original
# freeware game by mhman — characters remain property of their owners,
# see public/multihero/multihero-web/NOTICE.md). The native Windows copy
# and any extracted asset trees stay local only, never committed.
/MultiHero094/
*.exe
